1520
01:11:01.230 --> 01:11:01.430
No.

1521
01:11:01.550 --> 01:11:03.030
I think they do, Jenna.

1522
01:11:03.410 --> 01:11:10.510
I think they do because I think I love you, but you will play out the worst case scenario

1523
01:11:10.510 --> 01:11:12.410
