And in your mind, you're like, oh yeah, I, I would, I would think about that.

1529
01:11:24.230 --> 01:11:25.350
I can relate to that.

1530
01:11:25.610 --> 01:11:25.830
Yes.

1531
01:11:25.970 --> 01:11:27.190
Angela, thank you for saying this.

1532
01:11:27.430 --> 01:11:35.390
I found uncut gems very, I don't want to say soothing, but I just want to say that

1533
