1536
01:11:51.850 --> 01:11:52.350
Yeah.

1537
01:11:52.510 --> 01:11:53.290
You feel seen.

1538
01:11:53.510 --> 01:11:54.490
I think you feel seen.

1539
01:11:54.490 --> 01:11:54.970
Yeah.

1540
01:11:55.170 --> 01:12:00.390
So I, whereas I know like you or Lee watch a movie like that and you're like, I can't

1541
01:12:00.390 --> 01:12:01.790
handle this.

1542
01:12:02.050 --> 01:12:03.530
I can't do this.

1543
01:12:03.750 --> 01:12:04.030
Right.

1544
01:12:04.070 --> 01:12:06.050
That's not, that's not recreation for me.

1545
01:12:06.150 --> 01:12:07.890
