I want to watch Pride and Prejudice.

1547
01:12:09.910 --> 01:12:14.210
I want to watch Keira Knightley say, Mr. Darcy, Mr. Darcy.

1548
01:12:14.210 --> 01:12:14.870
Yeah.

1549
01:12:15.290 --> 01:12:15.770
Yeah.

1550
01:12:17.010 --> 01:12:21.790
Well, anyway, that was a little bit of a tangent, but I just want you to know that's Hunter.

