You know what?

1572
01:13:10.430 --> 01:13:13.730
I can enjoy both a Twizzler and a Red Vine.

1573
01:13:13.970 --> 01:13:17.110
But if I had to choose, I might go Red Vine.

1574
01:13:18.050 --> 01:13:19.050
I'm a Red Vine.

1575
01:13:19.270 --> 01:13:19.530
Yeah.

1576
01:13:19.850 --> 01:13:20.090
Yeah.

1577
01:13:20.230 --> 01:13:25.390
So there's now sort of this awkward apology moment where Roy apologizes to Jim and Jim's

1578
01:13:25.390 --> 01:13:26.230
like, yeah, no worries.

1579
01:13:26.230 --> 01:13:31.390
And then Dwight is ready, you know, in case he's, Roy's going to lunge again.

1580
