We see a shot of it and it says the Hungry Fox.

1589
01:13:48.970 --> 01:13:51.070
It's a real place and it's still there.

1590
01:13:51.290 --> 01:13:51.590
Yeah.

1591
01:13:51.710 --> 01:13:52.450
And I would go there.

1592
01:13:52.570 --> 01:13:56.270
They actually, they're sort of one of these places, guys, where you can get a little bit

1593
01:13:56.270 --> 01:13:56.710
of everything.

1594
01:13:56.930 --> 01:13:57.790
It's kind of like a diner.

1595
01:13:57.790 --> 01:14:00.050
And I've had their cheeseburger.

1596
