1607
01:14:41.610 --> 01:14:42.590
It's a farewell.

1608
01:14:42.670 --> 01:14:50.050
And I was so surprised that she would agree to let the camera crew come along.

1609
01:14:50.350 --> 01:14:54.110
It's interesting that you asked that question because I actually had the same thought.

1610
01:14:54.110 --> 01:14:59.970
I thought that it was interesting that this was done on camera.

1611
01:14:59.970 --> 01:15:05.590
But I had another thought, which was maybe Pam doesn't want to be alone with Roy.

1612
01:15:06.450 --> 01:15:07.430
Well, that's true.

1613
01:15:07.550 --> 01:15:12.770
The camera crew would have been a buffer, especially, you know, we learned that Pam had become friends

1614
01:15:12.770 --> 01:15:15.430
with some of the crew, right?

1615
01:15:15.670 --> 01:15:15.850
Yeah.

1616
01:15:15.950 --> 01:15:17.170
Later, we'll find that out.

1617
01:15:17.630 --> 01:15:17.890
Yeah.

1618
01:15:18.030 --> 01:15:21.130
So maybe it in some way was this buffer for this moment.

1619
01:15:21.130 --> 01:15:23.530
And she wasn't sure how that moment was going to play out.

1620
01:15:23.790 --> 01:15:24.130
Yeah.

1621
01:15:24.130 --> 01:15:30.250
So it might have made her feel, I don't know, a little better to have them there.

1622
01:15:30.850 --> 01:15:31.030
Yeah.

1623
01:15:31.330 --> 01:15:31.670
Okay.

1624
01:15:31.830 --> 01:15:32.710
I'll buy that.

1625
01:15:33.470 --> 01:15:37.050
Well, Roy really apologizes to Pam.

1626
01:15:37.830 --> 01:15:40.150
And she apologizes as well.

1627
01:15:40.370 --> 01:15:43.050
She says, we, you know, we both made bad decisions.

1628
