I don't know if it would be okay if he's just like curious and wanting to know up front.

1632
01:16:01.570 --> 01:16:06.030
So he knows what he has to hear about, you know, through the grapevine.

1633
01:16:06.390 --> 01:16:08.050
But Pam says no.

1634
01:16:08.490 --> 01:16:10.050
She's like, he has a girlfriend.

1635
