And Michael's like, what you're writing down, perv ball.

1678
01:18:29.160 --> 01:18:34.480
And then I'm telling you, Paul Lieberstein is Toby, crushes it in this talking head.

1679
01:18:34.560 --> 01:18:35.100
It's so good.

1680
01:18:35.100 --> 01:18:39.860
Talks about what a groundbreaking case this is going to be when it inevitably goes to trial.

1681
01:18:40.380 --> 01:18:41.460
It's so good.

1682
01:18:41.960 --> 01:18:45.900
Well, Michael cannot help but make this personal.

1683
01:18:46.680 --> 01:18:47.320
Yes.

1684
01:18:47.480 --> 01:18:50.380
Well, right out of the gate, he says we're lovers.

1685
01:18:50.760 --> 01:18:52.620
I mean, right, right away.

1686
01:18:55.290 --> 01:19:04.850
Jan says to Michael, listen, I can give you a 12% raise, but you have to ask me for 15%.

1687
01:19:04.850 --> 01:19:05.830
Okay.

1688
01:19:06.930 --> 01:19:10.850
So just ask for 15 and we'll settle at 12.

1689
01:19:11.630 --> 01:19:12.750
He doesn't get it.

1690
01:19:12.870 --> 01:19:13.730
He doesn't get it.

1691
01:19:14.970 --> 01:19:17.470
He says, I want a 15% raise.

1692
01:19:17.770 --> 01:19:19.370
She said, we can offer you 12.

1693
01:19:19.630 --> 01:19:21.530
And he says, you said 15.

1694
01:19:22.050 --> 01:19:23.510
And she's like, oh, Michael.

1695
01:19:23.510 --> 01:19:27.470
Well, he does end up getting his raise.

1696
01:19:27.850 --> 01:19:28.830
He does.

1697
01:19:28.950 --> 01:19:29.950
And so does Daryl.

1698
01:19:30.290 --> 01:19:34.250
And Michael explains that negotiating is an art form.

1699
